{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064863/block/singleImage/3273374/df/01M7VTS7HP04NGWRMTK46VTY17.png?updatedAt=1795156748\"/><figcaption>北角中銀兩男女持100張百元美鈔，職員揭為假鈔報警拉人。(Google街景截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (20 日 ) 上午 11 時 47 分，警方接獲一名銀行職員報案，指兩名男女手持 100 張面值 100 元美鈔到北角英皇道 131 號中國銀行入數，懷疑美鈔為偽鈔。警方接報到場，經調查後兩人涉「行使虛鈔」被捕，並被帶返警署作進一步調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.796660+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:39:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:18.479475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:20.955823+00:00","content_hash":"87dc0e393961a37299f022e647f9061ef4083938bdd773e127fab41492bec487","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}